    "status": "on_track",
    "notes": "All six tracked muscle groups showed clear strength index gains this period. Legs led the way with a jump from 108 to 115, closely followed by chest moving from 106 to 112 and back from 104 to 110. Triceps gained 5 points (104 to 109), shoulders gained 4 points (104 to 108), and biceps gained 4 points (102 to 106). These are consistent, across-the-board improvements with no signs of stalling or regression anywhere. Progressive overload is firmly on track."
