    "Maintain your current chest and back volume and loading — both are progressing strongly, and consistency here is the priority over the next period."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "All six muscle groups showed clear strength index gains this period with high total tonnage and no signs of fatigue; momentum is strong and minor imbalances in biceps load and shoulder volume are the main areas to address going forward."
